        "2": {
            "ID": "1919253",
            "URL": "https://thetvdb.com/series/requiem-street/seasons/official/2",
            "Titles": {
                "eng": "Rakshasa Street: The Northern Sect",
                "jpn": null,
                "zho": null
            },
            "Summaries": {
                "eng": "Cao Yanbing, the Soul Summoner of Rakshasa Street, and Xia Ling, the Soul Sender, set out on the road to repair the spirit acacia. However, the Soul Summoner of Feilin Street, Nam Oeu, is ordered to arrest Cao Yanbing, and the Soul Summoner of Bodhi Street, Beilu, steps in to calm down the situation. However, the Southern Soul Master and the Northern Soul Master are hiding secrets with the girl Shui Er, how will Cao Yan Bing and Xia Ling cope with the situation? Under the Bodhi Tree, the destinies of the three parties are intertwined, and where will they end up.",
                "jpn": null,
                "zho": "罗刹街镇魂将曹焱兵和寄灵人夏铃踏上修复灵槐之路，羽林街镇魂将南御夫却受命缉拿曹焱兵，恰有菩提街镇魂将北落师门出面平息事态。但南御夫心怀鬼胎，北落师门与女孩水儿也暗藏秘密，曹焱兵和夏铃又将如何应对。菩提树下，三方命运交结，最终会涌至何处。"
            },
